    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Connor Estate Agents are delighted to present 33 Kings Inn Court to the market. This superb duplex home is brought to the market in walk-in condition and has undergone significant upgrades and refurbishment in recent years to include: new Kitchen, new Bathroom, new Flooring and new Windows to name a few and a very efficient Energy Rating of B3. \r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of the bustling Phibsborough and within walking distance to host of services and amenities including Smithfield Market and Grangegorman. The property also benefits from access to a private gated car park. \r\n\r\nUpon entering the property there is a large hallway and to the front is the modern and fully equipped Kitchen which also provides a service hatch into the Living Room. The Living area has a feature Gas fireplace, ample Dining area and provides access to understair storage. The sun-drenched rear Garden also provides access to a private car park. The First Floor contains two double bedroom both with built in wardrobes and main Bathroom. \r\nThe property is well serviced by a number of bus routes (Bus Stop 189 is 1 min walk), the Luas Cross City (3 min walk) and enjoys an abundance of amenities on its doorstep including Blessington Street Basin Park located adjacent the development. It is an excellent City Centre location and a wide array of shops, bars, restaurants are all within striking distance as is the Grangegorman TU Campus. This superbly positioned property not only avails of all the amenities of Phibsborough but is a short stroll from Smithfield, Stoneybatter and Drumcondra Village. All main hospitals are only a few minutes away including; The Mater, Rotunda, Temple Street and The Bons Secours Hospital.\r\n\r\n**TRANSPORT** - This property is ideally positioned on Phibsborough Road and can easily avail of a host of convenient transportation options to include numerous Dublin Bus routes (1 min walk), Luas (3 mins walk) and Dublin Bikes. \r\n\r\n**AMENITIES** - There are an abundance of amenities all within easy reach in Phibsborough not to mention those within walking distance to include, Vue Cinema, Ilac Centre, Henry Street, Jervis Shopping Centre and a range of bars, shops, cafes and restaurants.  \r\n\r\nOn View By Appointment\r\n\r\n*PLEASE NOTE THAT LAYOUT PLANS WITHIN ARE FOR ILLUSTRATION PURPOSES ONLY AND MAY NOT BE TO SCALE*"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nEntrance Hall – Wooden Flooring throughout\r\nKitchen – c. 2.85m x 2.38m. Fully Fitted kitchen with floor and part wall tiling and a service hatch into the Living Room for convenience. \r\nLiving / Dining Room– c. 4.78m x 3.9m. Wooden Flooring throughout, feature Gas fireplace, separate storage and access to private rear Garden.   \r\nBedroom – c. 3.89m x 2.36m. Wooden Flooring throughout and built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom – c. 3.94m x 2.5m. Wooden Flooring throughout and built-in wardrobes.\r\nBathroom – c. 2.47m x 1.76m. Floor and part wall tiling with Bath with shower, toilet and wash hand basin."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Two Bedroom Home with off street private car parking. \r\nSuperb Central Location close to Smithfield, Stoneybatter & Grangegorman\r\nHas undergone extensive upgrading in recent years \r\nPart of a Small Private Gated Development\r\nPresented in Walk-in Condition\r\nGreat Transportation links\r\nGas Fired Central Heating \r\nEnergy Efficient BER rating of B3\r\nAnnual Service Charge approx. €950\r\nOn View by Appointment"
      },
